# The gantry link on slow passes, where the fight showed without it: the
# laser (200 Hz, +-4 A), the CMM on air bearings (208 Hz, 10 A, a 118 urad
# racking bridge) and the PCB driller (227 Hz after reversing), all three at
# the default gains with the link (machine/retrofit/*_glink.portal).
@program portal/portal_sim
@args portal/machine/retrofit/cmm_glink.portal
run 0.05
lcnc 1
run 0.3
move 0.8 250 350
run 0.3
mark
move 4 250 650
run 0.2
move 4 250 350
print max_cur_y1 max_cur_y2 max_rack fault_code
@expect portal.max_cur_y1 < 1
@expect portal.max_cur_y2 < 1
@expect portal.max_rack < 10
@expect portal.fault_code == 0
@reject ^ERROR
